<a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" title="Limitations. ‣ 5 Discussion ‣ Local Coverage Governs Memorization in Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§5</span></a>.
